# wip581: the SIDECHAIN dot must pulse with the input's sound whatever the intensity (it used to be scaled by the intensity: a small one looked fixed).
# Track 1 = the input (kick on steps 1 and 9), track 2 ducked, the threshold knob only a little left (intensity small).
wait 300
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w8
tap HOME
tap HOME
expect view 8
turn K4 -6 80
expect scint 6
turn ALGO 1
tapkey b1
expect scmask 2
turn ALGO -1
tapkey b1
shot dot_sends_idle.png
tap GLO
expect view 15
expect scduck 0
tap PLAY
wait 800
expect scduck >200
tap PLAY
tap HOME
tap HOME
tap PLAY
wait 90
shot dot_sends_play_a.png
wait 130
shot dot_sends_play_b.png
wait 130
shot dot_sends_play_c.png
tap PLAY
